  "label": "The text claims the average IQ of the depicted group is low, mapping onto the visual of the three men.",
  "description": "The overlaid text 'their average iq is about 70-80, few points above being retarded' is directly mapped onto the visual of the three men (three_men), who are identified as members of the Maasai ethnic group. The text attributes a false and derogatory intelligence level to them, creating an analogical mapping where the textual claim about intelligence is projected onto the visual representation of the individuals. This mapping is central to the meme's hateful intent, as it uses the visual of culturally rich individuals to reinforce a racist and ableist stereotype.",
